1 0 0 1 54 686 Tm (Thegame displays the intro text and waits for the user to press `Enter`. The first train) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 670 Tm (car appears with the player near the left side of the car, one zombie ahead, and a) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 654 Tm (closed door at the far right. The user presses `D` to move forward and `Space` to launch) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 638 Tm (the projectile. The projectile hits the zombie, the score increases to `1`, and the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 622 Tm (message changes to indicate that the infected was defeated or the door unlocked. The) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 606 Tm (user moves onto the open door to advance into the next car. The game redraws) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 590 Tm (continuously during this process without requiring line-based text input.) Tj
